TITLE 1D transport with exchange
SOLUTION 0 Inflow
    pH 7.0
    pe 4
    Na 1.0
    Cl 1.0
SOLUTION 1-10 Initial
    pH 7.0
    pe 4
    Ca 1.0
    Cl 2.0
EXCHANGE 1-10
    X 0.001
EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1-10
TRANSPORT
    -cells 10
    -shifts 10
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -reset false
    -high_precision true
    -step true
    -solution true
    -pH true
    -pe true
END
